sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SO as Sell Offer Subsystem
    participant BAL as Balance Subsystem

    Note over SO,BAL: Every state change is also emitted as an audit event to the Audit subsystem, asynchronously and off the trade path

    Note over SO,BAL: PHASE 1 - RESERVATION REQUEST
    SO->>BAL: Assets Reservation Request (requestId as idempotency key, supplier account, asset, volume, expiration) - sync
    BAL->>BAL: Check eligible balance: EXECUTED credits + EXECUTED and REQUESTED debits
    alt Not enough assets
        BAL-->>SO: Rejected INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE
        Note over SO: Reservation is not created
    else Enough assets
        BAL->>BAL: Create Debit record REQUESTED with expiration
        BAL-->>SO: Accepted (reservation id, expiration)
        SO-)BAL: OfferCreated (reservation id, offer id) - async, outbox and CDC
        alt Record still REQUESTED
            BAL->>BAL: Debit record REQUESTED to EXECUTED
            BAL-)SO: ReservationCompleted (async, CDC)
        else Record expired
            BAL-)SO: ReservationRejected (async, CDC)
        end
    end

    Note over SO,BAL: No confirmation arrives: nothing to update. The offer is not Available_For_Buying and the expired record is ignored, so the state stays consistent